            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1083-f4" n="5" xml:id="d1083-f4-content">
                <p>Stephen C. Brown, Consul at Shanghai.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1083-f5" n="6" xml:id="d1083-f5-content">
